Well, i have similar problem but i fix it like this:

``` javascript
$('input[name="PaymentForm[type]"]').change(function () {
                var form = $(this).closest('form');
                form.yiiActiveForm("destroy");
                form.append('<input type="hidden" name="countryUpdate" value="1" />');
                form.submit();
            });
```

Im my case i just need to submit form on change select option. 
In your case you can track click on this link and destroy ActiveForm.
